You're pairing with a designer to author visual contributions for the
Vincia Forge (https://forge.vincia.io). This is the Designer Kit v0.4.5.

Read these before generating anything:

1. `README.md` — kit layout + 2-archetype taxonomy (`website` / `portal`)
2. `docs/prompt-for-llm.md` — conversational intent-first flow
3. `docs/prompt-for-designer-llm.md` — structural contract, **RULES 1-25**
   (mandatory before any HTML — defines every `data-vincia-*` attribute the
   importer expects)
4. `docs/canonical-vocabularies.md` — archetypes, palettes, voices, motion

Pick the closest exemplar before authoring:

- Public website → `examples/wellness-habit-tracker-warm-earth-001/`
- Portal / admin → `examples/portal-admin-001/`
- Website + customer accounts → `examples/portal-website-dashboard-001/`

Self-check against `docs/validation-checklist.md` (the 9.5/10 bar). Smoke-render
against contrasting brands in `sample-brands/`.

Plugin / widget / connector code → separate
[Developer Kit](https://github.com/vincia-io/developer-kit).
